{
  "about": "S-settings - the undrawn states of Profil (/settings, PLAN 4.1 rule 7) and the frame data of settings-1 / settings-2. Every fixture is a list of edits over the recording of the same endpoint, or a mutation outcome with an empty body (R26). Every state is replay. Accounts: M = user@ (the member of both frames), A = admin@ (the admin row). Nothing is written live by this package.",
  "overrides": {
    "settings-1": {
      "why": "The frame is drawn for Takács Dániel (takacs.daniel@pelda.hu, 83,1 kg); the recording of M is Teszt Elek (user@tracker.local, last weight 83,436 kg on 2026-10-14). The edits set only the drawn name, address and the last weight, so the monogram, the name line and the figure can be compared box for box; balance (190) and 4 / 7 are M's recorded values. The state on the plain recording is settings-recorded. Verdict matched-fixture.",
      "fixtures": [
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/v1/auth/me",
          "edits": [
            {
              "pointer": "/user/display_name",
              "value": "Takács Dániel"
            },
            {
              "pointer": "/user/email",
              "value": "takacs.daniel@pelda.hu"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/v1/measurements",
          "edits": [
            {
              "pointer": "/measurements/41/value",
              "value": 83.1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "settings-2": {
      "why": "The same frame data as settings-1, and the frame draws the equipment status 'Felszerelés mentve' in the section head - a state that exists only after a tap. The script taps Rúd twice (the selection ends where the recording has it), lets the 700 ms autosave run, and the PATCH /onboarding is answered 200 by a fixture: nothing reaches the server. Verdict matched-fixture.",
      "fixtures": [
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/v1/auth/me",
          "edits": [
            {
              "pointer": "/user/display_name",
              "value": "Takács Dániel"
            },
            {
              "pointer": "/user/email",
              "value": "takacs.daniel@pelda.hu"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/v1/measurements",
          "edits": [
            {
              "pointer": "/measurements/41/value",
              "value": 83.1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "PATCH",
          "path": "/api/v1/onboarding",
          "status": 200,
          "body": {}
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "click": {
            "role": "checkbox",
            "name": "Rúd"
          },
          "arrived": {
            "role": "checkbox",
            "name": "Rúd",
            "checked": false
          }
        },
        {
          "click": {
            "role": "checkbox",
            "name": "Rúd"
          },
          "arrived": {
            "role": "checkbox",
            "name": "Rúd",
            "checked": true
          }
        },
        {
          "advance": 900,
          "arrived": {
            "text": {
              "key": "settings.equipmentSaved"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
